Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Ramp this month.

Procurement
Employees request a purchase, it routes to the right approver based on amount and department, and the PO, contract, and invoice all live in one place. No more "did anyone approve this?" in Slack.

Ramp Travel
Book flights and hotels inside Ramp with your policy applied automatically. Out-of-policy bookings ask for a reason before they go through.

AI accounting
Ramp now suggests GL codes and merchant categories for 95% of transactions, and drafts a note explaining anything unusual so your close runs faster.

Also shipped: vendor price benchmarking (see what other companies pay for the same SaaS), and a mobile approvals redesign.

